<h3>Comprehensive Psychiatric Services for Teens</h3>
<p>Our young adult psychiatric care focuses on treating a wide range of mental health conditions using both traditional and interventional approaches. We create personalized plans that may include medication management, psychotherapy, and advanced interventional treatments.</p>
<ul>
<li>Depression and mood disorders</li>
<li>Anxiety and panic disorders</li>
<li>ADHD (Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder)</li>
<li>Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder (OCD)</li>
<li>Behavioral issues and oppositional defiant disorder (ODD)</li>
<li>Self-harm and suicidal ideation</li>
<li>School-related stress and social difficulties</li>
</ul>
<h3>What Sets Our Teenage Psychiatry Services Apart</h3>
<ul>
<li>Specialized psychiatrists with experience in teen mental health</li>
<li>Safe, compassionate environment tailored to young adults</li>
<li>Family involvement to support long-term healing</li>
<li>Innovative treatment options such as TMS when appropriate</li>
<li>Collaborative care with pediatricians, schools, and therapists</li>
</ul>
